7533c-da43-4a83-854d-3dfc8acd5895","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"探してたけど多分\n`\"diagnostic.locationlistUpdate\": false` かな・・・","ts":"1628918560.311000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"NZOJl"}]},{"client_msg_id":"8c57d99b-9a65-4866-9d51-145dd9c27134","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"\u003c#CQ88WB7B3|tech-coc\u003e っぽいんですけどこっちで\ncocでts書いててQuickFixがDiagnosticsの更新で勝手に上書きされちゃうんですが、これって設定で打ち消せますかね？","ts":"1628917966.310600","edited":{"user":"U8996GYBF","ts":"1628917975.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"=Ob"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d1d95c40-3109-4c07-9979-f74e63acd28e","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"たぶんそう","ts":"1628877515.309600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"o0nO"}]},{"client_msg_id":"7a561fd9-9a40-483e-9afe-d7631bf0c3e6","type":"message","user":"U01D9BALEKU","text":"なるほど。。。ctrlpのバッファで実は`\u0026lt; N o p \u0026gt;` が実行されてたけどctrlpがﾅﾝﾔｶﾝﾔで吸って何も起きてなかったように見えていたということか","ts":"1628877485.309400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Obzfm"}]},{"client_msg_id":"babe2dcd-755f-45c6-8d79-076c524682d3","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"いや、抜いてもダメです。特殊な文字を `:normal` で実行するには `:execute` を使う必要があります。 `:execute 'normal!' \"\\\u0026lt;Nop\u0026gt;\"`","ts":"1628877381.308000","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"puro","count":1,"users":["U01D9BALEKU"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Sjn0"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c85d9ba9-cd58-4670-87d0-23e818909f2e","type":"message","user":"U01D9BALEKU","text":"あー\n\\抜きか","ts":"1628877265.307100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"bII"}]},{"client_msg_id":"750326e2-0f49-4ae8-a5ac-af36a3fc8520","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"ちなみにそれだと見た通りの文字が normal で実行されますねw","ts":"1628877237.306700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"zqq4f"}]},{"client_msg_id":"040c34e5-00e5-404c-9a83-5e74939c33e1","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"`:`を指定したらいけません？","ts":"1628876747.306000","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"puro","count":1,"users":["U01D9BALEKU"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"YV7B"}]},{"client_msg_id":"48be6c84-4aae-4317-8e53-afaacfe08916","type":"message","user":"U01D9BALEKU","text":"ところで「何もしない」コマンドって無いですか？\nわからんかったので`normal! \\\u0026lt;Nop\u0026gt;` とかやったんですけど","ts":"1628876713.305900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"el9aT"}]},{"client_msg_id":"be4a55a6-cf28-441a-a303-07c777f01203","type":"message","user":"U01D9BALEKU","text":"`autocmd FileType ctrlp command! ImeOff -buffer normal! \\\u0026lt;Nop\u0026gt;` で書き換えて回避しました","ts":"1628876663.305000","edited":{"user":"U01D9BALEKU","ts":"1628876684.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"IlH"}]},{"client_msg_id":"0ea4a040-2f68-4a53-a179-30b3ebedd783","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"つらい…","ts":"1628876626.304200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"GXpW0"}]},{"client_msg_id":"7d5fa405-e5ad-46ec-92a4-864f9cbdb474","type":"message","user":"U01D9BALEKU","text":"試しに`autocmd InsertLeave * echom \u0026amp;ft` してみたら`:mes` がctrlpで埋め尽くされたｗ","ts":"1628876609.304100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"BE7dQ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"27831c05-217b-48ae-a882-645ca7528d88","type":"message","user":"U01D9BALEKU","text":"いままでwindowsのみautohotkeyで作ったimeoff.exeがパス上にあって、最近家のubuntuでもxvkbdでできるというのを知ってelseif~を追加した\nubuntu PCは一台しか持ってないので、他のPCで確認したときは再現しなかったようです","ts":"1628874642.302800","edited":{"user":"U01D9BALEKU","ts":"1628876102.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"YGJ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"003dc544-95a2-4241-aa94-b7956fff27bd","type":"message","user":"U01D9BALEKU","text":"`autocmd InsertLeave` でimeがoffになるように以下のコマンドを定義しているのですが\n```if executable('imeoff.exe')\n  command! ImeOff call system('imeoff.exe')\nelseif executable('xvkbd')\n  command! ImeOff call system('xvkbd -text \"\\[Muhenkan]\"')\nelse\n  command! ImeOff normal! \\\u0026lt;Nop\u0026gt;\nendif```\n`xvkbd` を呼ぶ処理が遅い。\nCtrlPのウィンドウ上で１タイプごとにこれが呼ばれているっぽい","ts":"1628874531.301200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"i4f"}]},{"client_msg_id":"8f7d6c19-d691-4245-984d-e9f8f950ddd6","type":"message","user":"U01D9BALEKU","text":"ctrlpが遅い問題を特定した（自分のせい）","ts":"1628874376.299100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"RfNS"}]}]
